<p class="text-secondary/80 text-lg leading-[150%] font-normal">\u201CBudget planning used to be a nightmare with spreadsheets. Nexsas made it seamless. We can create, track, and adjust budgets in real-time, and the forecasting tools are incredibly accurate.\u201D</p>
