            <span style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:4px;color:#23253d;padding:8px 14px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;">\u2713 Batch Traceability</span>
